# McNugget diffusion instrumentation for llama.cpp (PR #24423 branch)
#
# Env-gated probes used by CONVERGENCE_SUBSCRIBED_INFERENCE_WIP.md. Zero cost when the
# env vars are unset. Saved here because they lived only in a local working tree, which
# made every measurement in that doc unreproducible if the checkout were cleaned.
#
#   base commit : c3fb97241295c196e09b783e705e84b96cd1bd74  (llama.cpp PR #24423 head)
#   apply       : git apply llamacpp-diffusion-instrumentation-mcnugget.patch
#
#   DIFF_ROUTE_LOG=<csv>        per-step MoE router top-k -> distinct experts/layer  (idea 1)
#   DIFF_ENTROPY_LOG=<csv>      per-step canvas entropy / accepted / held / confident (ideas 2,3)
#   DIFF_CANVAS_LOG=<csv>       per-step committed-token count
#   DIFF_CANVAS_DUMP=<file>     + DIFF_CANVAS_DUMP_STEP=<K>: dump working canvas at step K, stop
#   DIFF_CANVAS_LOAD=<file>     resume denoise from a dumped canvas (precision cascade)
#
# NOTE: the router probe (DIFF_ROUTE_LOG) must run on the CPU backend — mid-graph tensor
# reads crash Metal's command buffer.
